<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>DIAMOND BAR, Calif., Jan. 10, 2019 /PRNewswire/</strong></p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">The Chinese retail market and the global e-commerce industry as a whole is set to experience an unparalleled user experience ushered in by the partnership of two giants – CDNetworks, Inc., and Teamwork Retail LLC.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">CDNetworks, Inc., is a leading global content delivery network and provider of web acceleration and cloud security services, which recently partnered with the innovative retail platform, Teamwork Retail LLC and a leading fashion brand, to deliver a fully featured and compliant acceleration solution to their users, particularly in the Chinese market.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">The fashion brand enlisted the help of Teamwork Retail to implement a Point of Sale system in their stores across the globe, which includes their 3 stores in China. The company also sought assistance to provide 1.3 billion Chinese citizens with access to their online store while ensuring compliance with the laws set forth by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">The partnership between Teamwork Retail and CDNetworks also became necessary with the need for the company’s clients to expand their businesses in China. Consequently, it was imperative for Teamwork Retail to ensure the compliance, availability, and reliability of their solution. The coming together of CDNetworks and Teamwork Retail gave the retail giant access to CDNetworks’ High-Speed Data Transmission service to enable the company to ensure the performance and availability of their critical back-end infrastructure in China.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">CDNetworks has collaborated with the two companies to assist with the regulatory process in China. The world leading content delivery network will also provide their unique Dynamic Website Acceleration services to deliver an amazing shopping and user experience to customers of the fashion brand across the country. This is in addition to providing Teamwork Retail with optimized and ensured compliance of Point of Sale services.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Teamwork Retail LLC has grown over the years by providing customers with the best possible shopping experience. This is built on its cloud-based, mobile retail technology solution focused on creating a platform that is designed to meet the needs of the retailer.</p>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">More information about CDNetworks and the unique solutions provided by the company can be found on their <a href="https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&l=en&o=2344375-1&h=3642092403&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cdnetworks.com%2Fuk%2Fen&a=website" target="_blank" rel="noopener">website</a>. CDNetworks is also available across several social media platforms including <a href="https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&l=en&o=2344375-1&h=2868676646&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fpages%2FCDNetworks%2F156678131058653&a=Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&l=en&o=2344375-1&h=1074951463&u=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FCDNetworks&a=Twitter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter</a>, and <a href="https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&l=en&o=2344375-1&h=3316187988&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2F125361%2F&a=LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.<a href="https://www.cdnetworks.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a></p>
<h4>About CDNetworks</h4>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">CDNetworks is a leading global Content Delivery Network (CDN) with a fully integrated cloud solution offering unparalleled speed, security, and reliability for the prompt delivery of web and application content. The company offers users a fast and safe web experience – whether serving B2B or B2C customers, mobile employees or remote offices with content optimized for any device, browser, and network.<a href="https://www.cdnetworks.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a></p>
<h4>About Teamwork Retail</h4>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Teamwork Retail LLC provided a cloud-based, mobile retail technology solution focused on creating a platform that was tailored to the retailer’s needs. With clients that wanted to expand business in China, Teamwork Retail needed to be sure that they were compliant and that their solution was always available and performing well. CDNetworks’ High Speed Data Transmission service enabled them to ensure the performance and availability of their critical back-end infrastructure in China.</p>
